<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMERCO cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMERCO cut to neutral.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said on Thursday it cut its rating on the shares of AMERCO Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- AMERCO, the holding company for U-Haul International truck rentals, said late Wednesday its first quarter earnings would not meet analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>-- AMERCO shed 3-3/4 to 27-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
